油花略多，又有部分瘦肉略為乾柴，是今天表現比較差的地方。\n進來用餐的貌似都是常客，老闆娘都能夠立刻說出客人喜歡的配置，感覺還不錯，非常溫馨，有路過的話可以來試試看。",null,[0,180]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/1651202929112204821/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnQwU1dWVk1XeFBSVFExV2tVeFNWUnNiRTVTU0VaYVUwY3hSMWt4UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1651202929112204821/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnQwU1dWVk1XeFBSVFExV2tVeFNWUnNiRTVTU0VaYVUwY3hSMWt4UlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/1651202929112204821/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnQwU1dWVk1XeFBSVFExV2tVeFNWUnNiRTVTU0VaYVUwY3hSMWt4UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1651202929112204821/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnQwU1dWVk1XeFBSVFExV2tVeFNWUnNiRTVTU0VaYVUwY3hSMWt4UlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/1651202929112204821/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnQwU1dWVk1XeFBSVFExV2tVeFNWUnNiRTVTU0VaYVUwY3hSMWt4UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1651202929112204821/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnQwU1dWVk1XeFBSVFExV2tVeFNWUnNiRTVTU0VaYVUwY3hSMWt4UlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,6783,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2t0SWVVMWxPRTQ1WkUxSVRsbE5SSEZaU0cxR1kxRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xd3dbb977f85af1dd!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOktIeU1lOE45ZE1ITllNRHFZSG1GY1E%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2t0SWVVMWxPRTQ1WkUxSVRsbE5SSEZaU0cxR1kxRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2t0SWVVMWxPRTQ1WkUxSVRsbE5SSEZaU0cxR1kxRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2t0SWVVMWxPRTQ1WkUxSVRsbE5SSEZaU0cxR1kxRRILMGRRV2FMRm5lbkcaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09rdEllVTFsT0U0NVpFMUlUbGxOUkhGWlNHMUdZMUUSCzBkUVdhTEZuZW5HIhIJAAAAAAAAAAAR3fFa-He529MqCzBkUVdhTEZuZW5H\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026